    "markdown": "---\nengine: knitr\n---\n# Transforming variables\n![](/images/transform.png){style=\"width:200px; background:white; border-radius:5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n__<u id='variable'>Variables</u>__ can be transformed from one __<u id='class'>class</u>__ to another provided the value can be coerced into the new data type (I.e. you could not transform a  __<u id='string'>string</u>__ of text to a __<u id='float'>floating point numbers</u>__). \n\nCreate a new __markdown cell__ with the following:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\n### Transforming variables\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Float to integer\n\nTo transform a __<u id='float'>float</u>__ to an __<u id='integer'>integer</u>__ use the `int()` __<u id='function'>function</u>__ (note the loss of precision):\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\na_float = 17.45\nint(a_float)\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Integer to string\n\nTo transform an __<u id='integer'>integer</u>__ to a __<u id='string'>string</u>__ use the `str()` __<u id='function'>function</u>__:\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\nan_integer = 783473\nstr(an_integer)\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Numeric to integer\n\nYou can transform a numeric __<u id='string'>string</u>__ to an __<u id='integer'>integer</u>__:\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\na_numeric_string = \"256\"\nint(a_numeric_string)\n```\n:::\n\n\n## To float\n\nYou can also transform to a __<u id='float'>floating point</u>__ using `float()`:\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\na_float_string = \"3.14\"\nfloat(a_float_string)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-758d7b0eac95be5cdfec\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-758d7b0eac95be5cdfec\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs specific tasks\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a75ae393690ec8b371b5\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a75ae393690ec8b371b5\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, *, /, and more\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-47a1cbe5c24d9135a4bc\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-47a1cbe5c24d9135a4bc\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text, denoted by quotes (\\\"text\\\" or 'text')\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a3ef6169656fda012065\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a3ef6169656fda012065\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Whole numbers, e.g. 1, 2, 3, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-e4219089571140e872fd\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-e4219089571140e872fd\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"float\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Real numbers (can contain decimal point), e.g. 1, 2.5, 3.14, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-438242de09c8b6f88a26\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-438242de09c8b6f88a26\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"boolean\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"True or False\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-7bffe7c79a3b15a73498\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-7bffe7c79a3b15a73498\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of information with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-568167e122f27d87814d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-568167e122f27d87814d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Type of data, e.g. string, integer, float, boolean, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
